  "description": "Prevent cartesian explosion in NHibernate LINQ queries when eager loading multiple collections. Similar to Entity Framework Core's AsSplitQuery(), this library splits collection loading into separate database queries for 50-100x performance improvement. Works with FetchMany, ThenFetchMany, and all LINQ operators including First, Single, ToList and their async variants.",
  "id": "NHibernate.Extensions.AsSplitQuery",
